# The image builds from the repository root need little of it — keep the
# multi-GB qemu/ tree, toolchains and A/B snapshots out of the context:
#  - the site (deploy/nginx/Dockerfile): the bundle (dist/, from
#    scripts/bundle-dist.sh) and its own config;
#  - the relay (deploy/gsmrelay/Dockerfile): relay.py and its sound clips
#    only, never a local run's balances.json, numbers.json or relay.log.
*
!dist/
!dist/**
!deploy/
!deploy/nginx/
!deploy/nginx/**
!deploy/gsmrelay/
!deploy/gsmrelay/**
!gsmrelay/
!gsmrelay/smsrelay/
!gsmrelay/smsrelay/relay.py
!gsmrelay/clip/
!gsmrelay/clip/**
